OL,3,AWomen's criminal records wiped for
OL,4,Aabortion offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen arrested or convicted for having
OL,7,Fillegal abortions will have their
OL,8,Fcriminal records wiped as new automatic
OL,9,Fpardons come into force in England and
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FEnding the Victorian-era law should
OL,13,Favoid traumatic experiences such as
OL,14,Fthat of Nicola Packer, who was recently
OL,15,Fcleared by a jury after taking
OL,16,Fmedication at home during a Covid
OL,17,Flockdown. She had ended a pregnancy
OL,18,Fwithout realising she was around 26
OL,19,Fweeks pregnant, far beyond the legal 10
OL,20,Fweek limit.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
