OL,3,AWomen's criminal records wiped for
OL,4,Aabortion offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer friend Helle Tumbridge told the
OL,7,FBBC's Today Programme she had been
OL,8,F"treated appallingly" until justice was
OL,9,Fserved.
OL,11,FLabour MP Tonia Antoniazzi, who brought
OL,12,Fforward the decriminalisation amendment
OL,13,Flast year, says the change will clear
OL,14,Fthe names of more than 100 women who
OL,15,Fhave been "unnecessarily harmed" by an
OL,16,F"outdated" law.
